{
 "uid": "homelab-overview",
 "title": "Homelab",
 "description": "Start here: alerts, every box at a glance, links. Generated by dashboards/generate.py.",
 "tags": [
  "homelab"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "editable": false,
 "refresh": "1m",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-6h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "templating": {
  "list": []
 },
 "links": [
  {
   "title": "Homelab",
   "type": "link",
   "url": "/d/homelab-overview/homelab",
   "icon": "dashboard"
  },
  {
   "title": "Box details",
   "type": "link",
   "url": "/d/homelab-box/homelab-box",
   "icon": "info"
  },
  {
   "title": "Containers",
   "type": "link",
   "url": "/d/homelab-containers/homelab-containers",
   "icon": "apps"
  }
 ],
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "alertlist",
   "title": "Active alerts",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   },
   "description": "Firing and pending alerts from Prometheus and Loki (the same ones that push to the phone).",
   "options": {
    "viewMode": "list",
    "groupMode": "default",
    "groupBy": [],
    "maxItems": 30,
    "sortOrder": 1,
    "dashboardAlerts": false,
    "alertName": "",
    "alertInstanceLabelFilter": "{severity=~\"warning|critical\"}",
    "datasource": "",
    "folder": null,
    "showInstances": true,
    "stateFilter": {
     "firing": true,
     "pending": true,
     "recovering": true,
     "noData": false,
     "normal": false,
     "error": true
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Boxes reporting",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 7,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "max by (host) (up{job=\"integrations/unix\"})",
     "legendFormat": "{{host}}",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "time_series"
    }
   ],
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "description": "Green = this box's Alloy is sending metrics. Tap a box for its details page.",
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "textMode": "value_and_name",
    "orientation": "auto",
    "justifyMode": "center"
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "1": {
         "text": "Up",
         "color": "green"
        },
        "0": {
         "text": "Down",
         "color": "red"
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     "links": [
      {
       "title": "Open ${__field.labels.host}",
       "url": "/d/homelab-box/homelab-box?var-host=${__field.labels.host}"
      }
     ]
    },
    "overrides": []
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Boxes at a glance",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 11,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "CPU",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "1 - avg by (host) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"integrations/unix\", mode=\"idle\"}[5m]))",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "refId": "MEM",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "1 - (\n  (max by (host) (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\"})\n     + (max by (host) (node_zfs_arc_size{job=\"integrations/unix\"}) or max by (host) (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\"}) * 0))\n  / max by (host) (node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\"})\n  or\n  (max by (host) (node_memory_free_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\"} + node_memory_inactive_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\"} + node_memory_laundry_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\"}))\n  / max by (host) (node_memory_size_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\"})\n)",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "refId": "ROOT",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "1 - max by (host) (node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\", mountpoint=\"/\", fstype!=\"zfs\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\", mountpoint=\"/\", fstype!=\"zfs\"})",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "refId": "UP",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "max by (host) (time() - node_boot_time_seconds{job=\"integrations/unix\"})",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    }
   ],
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "description": "Memory excludes reclaimable cache (and the ZFS ARC on TrueNAS). Root disk = the OS disk (blank on ZFS boxes: TrueNAS and pfSense are in ZFS pools below).",
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "merge",
     "options": {}
    },
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "Time": true
      },
      "renameByName": {
       "host": "Box",
       "Value #CPU": "CPU",
       "Value #MEM": "Memory",
       "Value #ROOT": "Root disk",
       "Value #UP": "Uptime"
      },
      "indexByName": {
       "host": 0,
       "Value #CPU": 1,
       "Value #MEM": 2,
       "Value #ROOT": 3,
       "Value #UP": 4
      }
     }
    }
   ],
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true,
    "cellHeight": "sm",
    "footer": {
     "show": false
    }
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "percentunit",
     "decimals": 0,
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "orange",
        "value": 0.8
       },
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": 0.9
       }
      ]
     },
     "custom": {
      "align": "auto",
      "cellOptions": {
       "type": "color-text"
      }
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Box"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.cellOptions",
        "value": {
         "type": "auto"
        }
       },
       {
        "id": "links",
        "value": [
         {
          "title": "Open ${__value.text}",
          "url": "/d/homelab-box/homelab-box?var-host=${__value.text}"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Uptime"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "dtdurations"
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.cellOptions",
        "value": {
         "type": "auto"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "ZFS pools",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 11,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "FREE",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "max by (host, pool) (label_replace(node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\", fstype=\"zfs\"}, \"pool\", \"$1\", \"device\", \"([^/]+).*\")) / (sum by (host, pool) (label_replace(node_filesystem_size_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\", fstype=\"zfs\"} - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\", fstype=\"zfs\"}, \"pool\", \"$1\", \"device\", \"([^/]+).*\")) + max by (host, pool) (label_replace(node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\", fstype=\"zfs\"}, \"pool\", \"$1\", \"device\", \"([^/]+).*\")))",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "refId": "AVAIL",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "max by (host, pool) (label_replace(node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"integrations/unix\", fstype=\"zfs\"}, \"pool\", \"$1\", \"device\", \"([^/]+).*\"))",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    }
   ],
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "description": "Approximate (from per-dataset stats; snapshots and Docker's own datasets aren't counted, so the apps pool reads emptier than it is). Alerts at 20% / 10% free.",
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "merge",
     "options": {}
    },
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "Time": true
      },
      "renameByName": {
       "host": "Box",
       "pool": "Pool",
       "Value #FREE": "Free",
       "Value #AVAIL": "Free space"
      },
      "indexByName": {
       "host": 0,
       "pool": 1,
       "Value #FREE": 2,
       "Value #AVAIL": 3
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "sortBy",
     "options": {
      "sort": [
       {
        "field": "Free"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ],
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true,
    "cellHeight": "sm",
    "footer": {
     "show": false
    }
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "align": "auto"
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Free"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "percentunit"
       },
       {
        "id": "decimals",
        "value": 0
       },
       {
        "id": "thresholds",
        "value": {
         "mode": "absolute",
         "steps": [
          {
           "color": "red",
           "value": null
          },
          {
           "color": "orange",
           "value": 0.1
          },
          {
           "color": "green",
           "value": 0.2
          }
         ]
        }
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.cellOptions",
        "value": {
         "type": "color-text"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Free space"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "bytes"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "type": "logs",
   "title": "System errors (all boxes)",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 19,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 10
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "loki",
      "uid": "loki"
     },
     "expr": "{host=~\".+\", level=~\"(?i)err|error|crit|critical|alert|emerg\"}"
    }
   ],
   "datasource": {
    "type": "loki",
    "uid": "loki"
   },
   "description": "Error-level lines from each box's system journal, pfSense syslog and TrueNAS's own logs (not app/container output). Some are harmless noise; alerts cover the ones that matter.",
   "options": {
    "showTime": true,
    "wrapLogMessage": true,
    "sortOrder": "Descending",
    "enableLogDetails": true,
    "dedupStrategy": "none",
    "showLabels": false,
    "prettifyLogMessage": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "Links",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 29,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 9
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### Where to look\n\n- **Something's wrong?** The phone push names the box. Open it below, or tap it in *Boxes reporting*.\n- **One box in detail:** [truenas](/d/homelab-box/homelab-box?var-host=truenas) · [quack01](/d/homelab-box/homelab-box?var-host=quack01) · [frigate](/d/homelab-box/homelab-box?var-host=frigate) · [proxmox-k8s](/d/homelab-box/homelab-box?var-host=proxmox-k8s) · [proxmox-ha](/d/homelab-box/homelab-box?var-host=proxmox-ha) · [pfsense](/d/homelab-box/homelab-box?var-host=pfsense)\n- **Every metric for a box:** [Node Exporter Full](/d/rYdddlPWk/node-exporter-full) (its *Nodename* picker uses hostnames: `proxmox` = proxmox-k8s, `homeassistant` = proxmox-ha, `Quack01` = quack01)\n- **Containers (by stack: arr-stack, music-stack, immich, ...):** [Containers](/d/homelab-containers/homelab-containers) · cluster pods: *Kubernetes / Compute Resources* dashboards\n- **Search any log:** [Explore](/explore) → Loki → label `host`\n- **All alert rules:** [Alert rules](/alerting/list)\n\nUp/down for each service is in Uptime Kuma; admin UIs are bookmarked on the Home Assistant *Homelab* dashboard."
   }
  }
 ]
}
